21. {[d]}en#-lil₂-le igi zid bar-ra-me-en
#tr.en: You have been looked on favourably by @wDN{Enlil}.
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; igi[eye]; zid[right]; bar[place outside]
#etcsl: line-id=21

