60. {[d]}nin-tur₅-ra {ŋiš}banšur sig₇-ga-me-en
#tr.en: You make pleasing the offering table of @wDN{Nintur}.
#lem: Nintur[1]DN; banšur[table]; sissig[green-yellow]
#etcsl: line-id=60

61. {d}en-nu-gi₄-ra a₂ aŋ₂-ŋa₂ e₃-[a-me]-en#
#tr.en: You issue orders for @wDN{Ennugi}.
#lem: Ennugi[1]DN; a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=61

62. lugal-ra nam-til₃ mi₂ X [X-me]-en
#tr.en: You …… life for the king.
#lem: lugal[king]; namtil[life]; mi[cvne]; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=62

63. an ki us₂ dili-bi-še₃ X X X-me-en#
#tr.en: You …… over the single path of heaven and earth.
#lem: an[sky]; ki[place]; us[path]; dili[single]; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=63

64. a₂ aŋ₂-ŋa₂ e₂ {d}en-lil₂-ka-ta
#tr.en: At the command of the household of @wDN{Enlil},
#lem: a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; e[house]; Enlil[1]DN
#etcsl: line-id=64

65. me gal-gal-la zag gub-gub-bu-me-en {{%akk li-te-[...]}}
#tr.en: you …… the great divine powers,
#lem: me[Being]; gal[big]; zag[side]; gub[stand]; L
#etcsl: line-id=65

66. me zid-da IGI X X ŋa₂-<<RI>>-ŋa₂-me-en
#tr.en: you …… the good divine powers,
#lem: me[Being]; zid[right]; X; X; X; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=66

67. me mah-a uₓ(PA)-a zid-me-en
#tr.en: you are the good provider of the majestic divine powers,
#lem: me[Being]; mah[great]; ua[provisioner]; zid[right]
#etcsl: line-id=67

68. me ul-e pa e₃ ak-me-en
#tr.en: you make manifest the everlasting divine powers;
#lem: me[Being]; ul[distant time]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; ak[do]
#etcsl: line-id=68

69. me tug₂-ba₁₃ šag₄-gada-la₂-a-me-en
#tr.en: you are clothed in the divine powers of @fsux{ba} garments and linen garments;
#lem: me[Being]; ba[garment]; šaggadala[priest]
#etcsl: line-id=69

70. me nun-na gu₂ me-er-me-re-me-en
#tr.en: you make the princely divine powers prosper,
#lem: me[Being]; nun[prince]; gu[neck]; mer[cvve]
#etcsl: line-id=70

71. me niŋ₂ lu-a-ba šu du₇-a-me-en
#tr.en: you perfect the multitude of the divine powers.
#lem: me[Being]; niŋ[thing]; lu[abundant]; šu[hand]; du[perfect]
#etcsl: line-id=71

72. {d}a-nun-na diŋir gal-gal-e-ne
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, the great gods, all honour you with due praise:
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]
#etcsl: line-id=72

73. za₃-mi₂ imin X X zid# ri-in-ne
#tr.en: @q[Anuna,Nuska]{“Minister,
#lem: zamin[praise]; imin[seven]; X; X; zid[right]; e[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=73

74. sukkal šu-luh [X X] a₂-nun-ŋal₂-me-en
#tr.en: you are endowed with princely strength …… the lustration rites.
#lem: sukkal[secretary]; šuluh[ritual cleansing]; X; X; anunŋal[strong]
#etcsl: line-id=74

75. šag₄ zalag-zalag a-a {d}en-lil₂-ka-me-en
#tr.en: You gladden Father @wDN{Enlil's} heart!”} Praise be to @wDN{Nuska},
#lem: šag[heart]; zalag[bright]; aya[father]; Enlil[1]DN
#etcsl: line-id=75

76. za₃-mi₂ dug₄-ga kingal {d}nuska
#tr.en: the leader of the assembly!
#lem: zamin[praise]; dug[speak]; kingal[an official]; Nuska[1]DN
#etcsl: line-id=76

77. munus zid mul an-da šag₄ kuš₂-u₃
#tr.en: Praise to @wDN{Nisaba}, the righteous,
#lem: munus[woman]; zid[right]; mul[shine]; An[1]DN; šag[heart]; kušu[tired]
#etcsl: line-id=77

78. {d}nisaba za₃-mi₂
#tr.en: glorious woman who consults with @wDN{An}!
#lem: Nisabak[1]DN; zamin[praise]
#etcsl: line-id=78

